SUMMARY:[Grant Radar] CCBHC Planning\, Development & Implementation (SM-26-014) — outreach window (award list ~2026-11-15)
DESCRIPTION:The real play here is post-award\, not the Aug 17 deadline. MORE can't apply directly\, and cold outreach to unknown applicants this week is low-yield — instead reach the ~94 funded CCBHCs directly once SAMHSA's award list publishes (~Nov 15) as their EBP/training partner under Allowable Activities #3/#10. Pre-name MORE in a known applicant's Section C before 8/17 only where we already have the relationship.\n\nPath: Line-item · Priority 20.9\nhttps://www.samhsa.gov/grants/grant-announcements/sm-26-014
